# The egress mode for control.nft: LOG-ONLY. A container's call to a host that isn't on its list is logged
# ("vha-egress-would-drop", kernel log, `journalctl -k`) and let through. Run this first, read the log, fix the lists.
# Switch at runtime: nft -f /etc/vha/nft/egress-log-only.nft   (or egress-enforce.nft)
flush chain inet vha egress_final
add rule inet vha egress_final counter name egress_logged
add rule inet vha egress_final limit rate 20/second log prefix "vha-egress-would-drop " level info
add rule inet vha egress_final accept
